                         About Lightning FileLister

A feature of this AmigaGuide file list of special interest to Fidonet nodes
is that clicking on any file in the list will add the file to a FREQ (File
REQuest) file in your outbound: directory. You may then receive these files
simply by having your frontend mailer poll the node. In order for this
feature to work properly, you must have outbound: (a standard assignment
used by most Fidonet systems) assigned to the directory your frontend mailer
is configured to find outgoing files in.
